{
 "duration": 28.388,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Maya had wanted to hike the Smokies for years.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 2.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Someday, she always said.",
   "start": 3.35,
   "end": 4.738
  },
  {
   "text": "Someday never came, because she never sat down to plan it.",
   "start": 5.188,
   "end": 8.308
  },
  {
   "text": "Tonight she did.",
   "start": 8.758,
   "end": 9.691
  },
  {
   "text": "Where to stay, which entrance to use, a three-day route, and ten day hikes ready on her phone.",
   "start": 10.141,
   "end": 15.587
  },
  {
   "text": "Spring wildflowers in April.",
   "start": 16.037,
   "end": 17.809
  },
  {
   "text": "One evening of planning, and someday got a date.",
   "start": 18.259,
   "end": 20.854
  },
  {
   "text": "Last day of our sale: guides are 25% off until midnight Eastern.",
   "start": 21.304,
   "end": 25.972
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next big trip.",
   "start": 26.422,
   "end": 28.188
  }
 ],
